1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,330
My dad's been dead sixteen years.

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:04,760
His toll pass still gets charged.

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,689
Every Friday.

4
00:00:06,689 --> 00:00:09,450
2:15 a.m. Same booth.

5
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:11,330
They said it's a glitch.

6
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:13,470
So I waited at that booth.

7
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:15,200
Nothing came through.

8
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,320
The charge showed up anyway.

9
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,020
Then my son called.

10
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,954
His car died on that road.

11
00:00:21,954 --> 00:00:23,300
At 2:15.

12
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,060
An old green Kenworth stopped to help.

13
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,510
The driver said just one thing:

14
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:30,488
"Tell your dad...

15
00:00:30,488 --> 00:00:32,110
leave room to stop."
